  "note": "Annual election of one-third of the Donaghadee Urban Council, polled Tuesday 15 January 1924 (Belfast News-Letter, 16 January 1924, p. 8). Eight candidates for four seats; the Ratepayers' Association's four nominees, who were the retiring members, were returned at the top of the poll. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026)."
